          "description": "The mithril mace is a power level 6 one-handed melee weapon that can be crafted at a blacksmith's bench.\n\n(Journal)\nThe standard term is mace, but Vannaka prefers bludgeon. \"It's one of those sound words, like stomp and grunt, right? When I hit someone with it, it bludges. Bludge, bludge, bludge.\"\n\n\"You're thinking of onomatopoeia,\" Dionysius said, helpfully. \"Nah, but good try. I'm thinking of breakfast,\" said Vannaka."
