          "description": "A adamant crossbow is a power level 7 crossbow crafted at a fletching bench.\n\n(Journal)\nYou’ll be pleased to learn, dear adventurer, that the first person to make this crossbow in Ashenfall is, indeed, you… or your friend if there are a few of you around.\n\nThe techniques that create them are no different to the previous crossbows, but the wood is sturdier, stronger and capable of sufficiently more damage when wielded with skill.\n\nThe Moon Garou are traditionalists, preferring the art of archery in hunting and combat, so why not take this opportunity to show them how much they’re missing out."
