          "description": "The orange desert cape is a stylish cape that takes no materials to craft. The recipe is unlocked after studying the orange memory of Menaphos vestige, which can be found in chests in Umbral Sands.\n\n(Journal)\nAn autumnal cape in the Menaphite style. Though not technically Menaphite in design, these Moon Garou creations were heavily influenced by the “River Mother”, a visiting goddess with a strong connection to the Menaphite deserts."
