          "description": "The shadowscale cape is a stylish cape that can be created by learning the vestige from skeletal marauders and rotsworn marauders, both dropping the vestige at a 1/100 drop rate.\n\n(Journal)\nThis cape is all that remains of the once proud archers of Fellhollow. Hunters and scouts who would stalk the forests and woodland hunting game to feed the other villagers. As the time dragged on their flesh and clothes have rotted away, leaving only this cape as a reminder of their existence."
