          "description": "The yellow hex cape is a stylish cape that can be created by learning the vestige bought from Postie Pete in Evil Emporium.\n\n(Journal)\nA wise purchase. While it doesn't make you invisible or grant you super-powers, this cape does make a delightful swishing noise as you sashay."
