          "description": "Pungent omelette is a consumable food item that provides 70 health and 70 sustenance as well as the perk Fungal Fortitude, which reduces Poison buildup by 33% for 300 seconds. It is made with fried cabbage, grilled mushrooms, and fried egg in a cooking range.\n\n(Journal)\nGet a nose peg for this one. The aroma that wafts from this culinary creation is almost unholy in its sensation. It reaches down from your nostrils into your throat, then it winds its way into your mouth and twists your tastebudstaste buds is two words in ways that must surely be illegal.\n\nStill, if you can fight through the stench, then this eggy abomination is surprisingly tasty and helps fortify your body against toxic elements.\n\nThe “if” is doing a lot of work in that statement though."
