          "description": "Weak Antipoison potion grants the perk Antipoison, which removes Poison stacks and grants 33% resistance from Poison buildup for 5-minutes (300 seconds). It is made with marrentil, bittercap mushroom, and clay vessel in a brewing cauldron.\n\n(Journal)\nPoison has always been a problem for hunters. The forests are full of venomous creatures, just waiting for a chance to strike. The difference between an edible mushroom and one filled with deadly toxins is hard to spot on a moonless night. Thus, the Antipoison Potion was one of the first potions to be created. A glorious catch-all that fought against all the venoms and toxins of the realm.\n\nThey’re also surprisingly good for a hangover."
