          "description": "Weak Focused Cooking potion grants the perk Focused Cooking, which provides a 5-minute (300-second) +15% XP boost for the Cooking skill. It is made with marrentil, cabbage, and clay vessel in a brewing cauldron.\n\n(Journal)\nIt's easy to forget that cooking is more than just throwing ingredients into the pot and applying fire. There are balances of flavours; the subtle blending of ingredients to create that perfect combination. This potion assists in this by enhancing the chef's smell and tastebuds\"tastebuds\" is two words, so they can tell just how much of an ingredient needs to be added for optimal results."
