          "description": "Weak Focused Mining potion grants the perk Focused Mining, which provides a 5-minute (300-second) +15% XP boost for the Mining skill. It is made with marrentil, animal bone, and clay vessel in a brewing cauldron.\n\n(Journal)\nThis potion makes it easier to swing a pickaxe. Your muscles are more relaxed and able to handle greater strain, making it easier to strike at the ore, learning its weak points.\n\nDruids used to whip up huge batches of this for visiting dwarves, who would mix it with beer for dubious results."
