          "description": "Weak Focused Woodcutting potion grants the perk Focused Woodcutting, which provides a 5-minute (300-second) +15% XP boost for the Woodcutting skill. It is made with marrentil, feathers, and clay vessel in a brewing cauldron.\n\n(Journal)\nWoodcutting is less about speed and strength, and more about precision. This potion hones your senses, allowing you to repeatedly attack the same spot on the tree trunk. The result is more efficiently felled trees and far fewer splinters."
