          "description": "Super Antifire potion grants the perk Antifire, which removes Burning stacks and grants 33% resistance from Burning buildup for 600 seconds (10 minutes). It is made by using an Antifire potion in an imbuing barrel.\n\n(Journal)\nThis potion was created by a Moon Garou chef with ambitious far greater than their common sense. They yearned to create the greatest grilled steak ever made and required rather more fire than their kitchen was equipped to handle.\n\nThe resulting conflagration was so impressive, that it inspired a local alchemist to create this magnificent countermeasure."
