          "shops": [],
          "perks": [],
          "description": "Super Focused Woodcutting potion grants the perk Focused Woodcutting II, which provides a 10-minute (600-second) +30% XP boost for the Woodcutting skill. It is made by using a Focused Woodcutting potion in an imbuing barrel.\n\n(Journal)\nThis potion gives you lumber tunnel vision, where the tunnel is made of tasteful wood rather than bricks. All there is - aside from the tunnel - is you and the tree, mano et arboro. One of the greatest, most heated rivalries of all time."
