          "description": "A gold bar is a component of making a variety of armour. Gold bars are used for making dragonkin mage and wild archer armour.\n\n(Journal)\nForged from gold ore, this glistening block of metal has been the cause of many conflicts over the ages. Stockpiles of them have been instrumental in dwarven civil wars and there are still plenty of people today who would gladly slit their sibling’s throat, just for a single bar."
