          "description": "Silver ore is a basic Mining material mined from silver ore nodes, which are mainly found in the Bloodblight Swamp. It can be smelted at a furnace to make silver bars.\n\n(Journal)\nSilver is an excellent conductor of magic. It’s why it shows up in so many legends and myths about supernatural foes. As a precious metal, it is highly prized in the crafting of jewellery and strongly disliked by lycanthropes everywhere."
