          "perks": [],
          "description": "Gypsum is a basic Mining material mined from gypsum nodes, found scattered across the Umbral Sands.\n\n(Journal)\nThere are more glamorous rocks to mine than gypsum. If you want to get an amorous wink from a dwarf then you should probably aim for diamond or adamantite. But gypsum is an honest, hard-working rock that is exceptionally practical. Gypsum just needs a better PR agent."
