          "description": "Antlers are obtained by killing deer and are used in drinks, weapons, and armour.\n\n(Journal)\nNature’s attempt to better the blacksmith’s craft, these powerful horns can do a lot of damage to their target when correctly applied. Fortunately they have a number of uses outside of skewering one’s organs, making them a useful resource prized by all skilled hunters and survivalists."
