          "description": "Dragon blood is a drop from dragon wolves and dragons.\n\n(Journal)\nThe blood of a dragon is a strange thing. It is infused with magic in a way that most other creatures can't match, a side effect of the alchemical processes that created their kind. Dragonkin scientists needed blood that could adapt to a wide range of chimeric additions to the body. As such, dragon blood, unlike human blood, doesn't possess any particular type, and each could act as donor\"a donor\" not \"donor\" to the other."
