          "description": "Ash planks are made by using ash logs on a sawmill. Ash planks can be used for construction or as an alternative to creating charcoal.\n\n(Journal)\nLogs are great, but their shape can cause trouble in construction. Planks can be fitted into much more interesting patterns, which can help in building sturdier structures."
