          "description": "Thorny irit root requires a steel logging axe to fell. Thorny irit roots can be found in the town of Emberwood, near the surrounding larger lake, in and near the ruined buildings.\n\n(Journal)\nIrit is normally much more manageable and leafy, but here in Fellhollow it was twisted into a hateful thorn-covered vine. Mind your fingers when harvesting it."
