          "description": "Astral runes can be crafted at a rune altar at level 3 Runecrafting or higher. Astral runes are used in enchanting weapons, finding/gathering resources easily, accessing chests, and providing shelter.\n\n(Journal)\nAstral runes borrow resonance from the stars, that silent hum when looking up at the night sky. They embody the power of distance and displacement, action from inaction, movement in the dark. Astral runes are used primarily in spells designed to summon an object to the caster’s location, making it a very popular rune with the lazier magicians."
