          "description": "Cactus water is a consumable drink item that provides 25 hydration and grants the perk Frosted Flavours that grants resistance to scorch buildup for 300 seconds.\n\n(Journal)\nIf you think about it, a cactus is a pocket oasis. It is foliage and water in a concentrated space, deep within the desert. And for a desperate adventurer like yourself, thirsty from the Scorch, it can taste many times better than a pool back in Brynmoor."
