          "description": "A mithril pickaxe is a power level 6 pickaxe that can be crafted at a blacksmith's bench. It can mine the same ores as the previous tiers along with limestone, dealing 82 damage to minable ores, and 164 with a critical swing.\n\nThe recipe and ability to craft the Mithril pickaxe are unlocked upon obtaining Maple logs for the first time.\n\n(Journal)\nA sign of mining distinction, the mithril pickaxe will get you noticed if you hang out with the right mining crowds. Doric in particularly will give you an appreciative wink. He might even toss you a rock cake or two.\n\nThe mithril pickaxe is cold to the touch, incredibly reflective and - most importantly - strong as an ox. You will no doubt have already realised that it makes short work of any deposit you find."
