          "description": "The ash rod is a power level 2 Fishing tool crafted at the crafting table. You must reach Fishing level 3 to unlock this recipe.\n\n(Journal)\nAh, the ash rod. It's been here from the First Age and will be here for many ages to come. Ever reliable, it gets the job done. Line up all the tools in the world and the ash rod will likely be named the most productive and certainly the most loved.\n\nAll hail the ash rod!"
