          "description": "Kalphite bait is a power level 7 bait crafted at the crafting table. It can be used to increase the chance of catching Raw Beltfish. Players can store the bait in a tackle box, which holds up to 48 baits.\n\n(Journal)\nA fish can't swallow an entire kalphite. They might want to, as elastic as their mouths are, but a fish cannot cross the line from admiring a kalphite to digesting it.\n\nThat's where you come in. With a slice here and there, suddenly a fish gets to try am morsel of antennae or mandible. And let me tell you: if the size roles were reversed, the kalphite would be wiped out in a week."
