          "description": "Steel arrows are a power level 5 ammunition that are crafted at a fletching bench.\n\n(Journal)\nTraditional wisdom says that to kill a zombie, you must destroy the brain. This is disappointingly untrue in Fellhollow, the animating force of Imaru’s hunger needs no thought to drive it forward.\n\nNo, a far better plan is to destroy the bones and muscles with sharp metal-tipped spikes launched at the creatures with as much force as you can manage. Steel arrows perform this task very nicely."
