          "description": "Bone bolts are a power level 5 ammunition that can only be fired from Dorgeshuun crossbows. Bone bolts are unlocked after completing the quest, Even More Restless Ghosts. Unlike other bolts that split their damage between the crossbow and the bolt, all of it is on the crossbow so that it ascends properly.\n\n(Journal)\nSpecial bolts whittled from bones. Whilst only of use for a very specific crossbow, these bolts pack a surprising amount of punch."
